za a desdibujarse.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Comedia","Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1284186","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:47:47.391Z"},{"id":"movie-1195803","slug":"movie-1195803","title":"Wicker","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ewPz6uvKrbKlQrLRi1r9NTZQLzN.jpg","synopsis":"Una pescadora vive en la periferia de un pueblo costero; es soltera, apestosa y objeto de burlas constantes. Un día, harta de sus estirados y estrechos vecinos, encarga un marido de mimbre para ella.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Romance","Fantasía","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1195803","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:47:47.691Z"},{"id":"movie-1284046","slug":"movie-1284046","title":"Aniquilación","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tRVR2QNr7ua6xEL226N0zRVeDI.jpg","synopsis":"Una francotiradora del ejército utiliza sus habilidades para proteger a su hija de un escuadrón de máquinas asesinas que escapó de una base militar secreta, mientras unos mercenarios intentan contenerla.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1284046","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:47:47.991Z"},{"id":"movie-1288069","slug":"movie-1288069","title":"Tenzing","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5i3qw2aDNQP6SWl2hNQaiIoUYHE.jpg","synopsis":"Un hombre se embarca en una arriesgada expedición para, contra todo pronóstico, intentar cumplir el sueño de ser el primero en alcanzar la cima del Everest.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Historia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1288069","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:47:48.292Z"},{"id":"movie-1422041","slug":"mov