ría. Éste está convencido de que el mal no es físico sino espiritual, es decir, que la niña es víctima de una posesión diabólica. Por eso, con la ayuda de otro sacerdote decide practicar un exorcismo.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/9552","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":1973,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:52:25.583Z"},{"id":"movie-1542884","slug":"movie-1542884","title":"4 இடியட்ஸ்","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zcHMRPurZAF9SOrKIwT2WtjX9JH.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1542884","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:52:25.903Z"},{"id":"movie-1462229","slug":"movie-1462229","title":"飞驰人生3","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fzkfI2LWgPEHiFOFW2JveqlAY3h.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1462229","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:52:26.201Z"},{"id":"movie-1620711","slug":"movie-1620711","title":"Its Presence Between Us","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f1sxYpzsLLMnX1p5mpUKbPRBXt2.jpg","synopsis":"Un horror de comedia romántica que proporciona una historia con cautela de lo que puede suceder si no te permites ser pequeño frente a quienes te aman.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1620711","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:52:26.519Z"},{"id":"movie-1642494","slug":"movie-1642494","title":"Murder in the Highland Manor","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rsZpzA7Ssu9m3X3fCcEDxjPXFet.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Suspense","Misterio","Película de TV"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"ht