queda llevará a Django y a Schultz hasta Calvin Candie, el malvado propietario de la plantación \"Candyland\". La presencia de ambos en los alrededores de la propiedad, despierta las sospechas de Stephen, el esclavo de confianza de Candie.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Western"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/68718","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2012,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:53:28.844Z"},{"id":"movie-1501342","slug":"movie-1501342","title":"49 Miles More","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lqLfe6Ixz1lVGnQeICA8NsZpQTu.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Drama","Aventura"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1501342","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:53:29.144Z"},{"id":"movie-363088","slug":"movie-363088","title":"Ant-Man y la Avispa","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bvYI6i9lQ3bsup9PgnMF3YYr8ZR.jpg","synopsis":"Mientras Scott Lang se convierte en un súper héroe y en un padre, Hope van Dyne y el Dr. Hank Pym presentan una nueva misión urgente que encuentra a Ant-Man luchando junto a The Wasp para descubrir secretos de su pasado.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Aventura","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/363088","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2018,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:53:29.440Z"},{"id":"movie-1472210","slug":"movie-1472210","title":"Goody Goody","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9DyaSMQ6W3NvJ9BYTV2piiAXlCX.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1472210","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:53:29.738Z"},{"id":"movie-1401973","slug":"movie-1401973","title":"McConadilla","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gRKg1Km5VmKOTcXkeMKmtNTiQdH.jpg