rio Astronómico Nacional de Nobeyama ha sido atacado.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Acción","Misterio","Crimen"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1396965","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:54:42.974Z"},{"id":"movie-10439","slug":"movie-10439","title":"El retorno de las brujas","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sOBr6cJVh3X9woaJNf47rgVHFbO.jpg","synopsis":"Tres brujas del siglo XII son invocadas durante la noche de Halloween en la ciudad de Salem, Massachusetts, de manera accidental por unos niños. Desterradas hace 300 años por sus prácticas de brujería, este trío prometió volver algún día para sembrar el caos. Ahora aprovecharán la ocasión para cumplir su promesa.  Una comedia realizada por la factoría Disney con vistas a su exhibición en la fiesta de Halloween.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Fantasía","Comedia","Familia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/10439","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":1993,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:54:43.281Z"},{"id":"movie-1545953","slug":"movie-1545953","title":"Mayumi","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hFjKtAzRjFcBmudFXvTC27STVXI.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1545953","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:54:43.584Z"},{"id":"movie-1668364","slug":"movie-1668364","title":"Deseo","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hzyByMOgLeYwu13fusOwIPJwMNV.jpg","synopsis":"Una abogada casada tiene una aventura con el entrenador de natación de su hija, y su tórrido romance acaba en un juego retorcido en el que todos pierden el control.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Misterio","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1668364","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-