418657","title":"The Yeti","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zaqEfoKcWkVni2eONhJ7DRhMO8Q.jpg","synopsis":"El famoso aventurero Hollis Bannister y el magnate del petróleo Merriell Sunday Sr. desaparecen sin dejar rastro en los parajes salvajes azotados por el viento del norte de Alaska. Mientras Ellie Bannister y Merriell Sunday Jr. emprenden la búsqueda de sus padres desaparecidos, el peligro aumenta en la nieve. Algo se ha dado cuenta de su expedición... el yeti.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1418657","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:55:57.401Z"},{"id":"movie-1179380","slug":"movie-1179380","title":"കോസ്മിക് സാംസൺ","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bLZt3m1itByeC8PubRkRQ3Lmqey.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Post Production","country":null,"genres":["Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1179380","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:55:57.705Z"},{"id":"movie-277834","slug":"movie-277834","title":"Vaiana","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y6wkgEH1gTWAafH9Bc7cNNut0Kf.jpg","synopsis":"Una gran aventura acerca de una enérgica adolescente que se embarca en una misión audaz para salvar a su pueblo de una antigua y misteriosa amenaza, en un viaje de autodescubrimiento. La acompañará el arrogante semidiós Maui, quien la guiará en su travesía por el océano en un viaje lleno de acción, plagado de temibles criaturas e imposibles desafíos para restaurar el orden perdido.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Comedia","Familia","Animación"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/277834","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2016,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:55:58.009Z"},{"id":"movie-1254594","slug":"movie-1254594","title":"Omukade","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7RdzEmKj2yy3DttYkvZ6G5cCtoE.jpg","synopsis":"Se desarrolla en una mina maldita durante la Segunda Guerra Mundial en Tailandia. Soldados japoneses y cautivos se enfrentan a un antiguo monstruo mientras las tensiones enemigas aumentan, creando una escalofriante experiencia de terror.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense","Bélica"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1254594","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:55:58.314Z"},{"id":"movie-1481869","slug":"movie-1481869","title":"Neues Land","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iAYJT3GTjuGLz3aYWOzUhhpmdQd.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Película de TV"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1481869","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:55:58.619Z"},{"id":"movie-1109255","slug":"movie-1109255","title":"Parthenope","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pHeUdYRCv5qw0lPp9R6DP9LNuy4.jpg","synopsis":"El largo viaje de la vida de Parthenope, desde su nacimiento en 1950 hasta hoy. Una epopeya femenina desprovista de heroísmo pero rebosante de una pasión inexorable por la libertad, Nápoles y los rostros del amor, todos esos amores verdaderos, inútiles e indecibles. El perfecto verano de Capri, el desenfado de la juventud, que acaba en emboscada. Y luego todos los demás: los napolitanos, hombres y mujeres, observados y amados, desilusionados y vitales, sus olas de melancolía, sus ironías trágicas y sus miradas abatidas. La vida, ordinaria o memorable, sabe ser muy larga. El paso del tiempo ofrece un vasto repertorio de emociones. Y ahí al fondo, tan cerca y tan lejos, está Nápoles, esa ciudad inefable que hechiza, encanta, grita, ríe y siempre sabe cómo hacerte daño.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1109255","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2024,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:56:00.732Z"},{"id":"movie-1643354","slug":"movie-1643354","title":"Live It Up: The Mental As Anything Story","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k9FXdUWiBwwMAA23wJwNhHF0l5R.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Documental","Música"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1643354","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:56:01.034Z"},{"id":"movie-1559446","slug":"movie-1559446","title":"Herkules falder","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pUlhe1liHtbj9MyogLQdguDySLu.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1559446","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:56:01.334Z"},{"id":"movie-1271","slug":"movie-1271","title":"300","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h7Lcio0c9ohxPhSZg42eTlKIVVY.jpg","synopsis":"Adaptación del cómic de Frank Miller (autor del cómic 'Sin City') sobre la famosa batalla de las Termópilas (480 a.C.). El objetivo de Jerjes, emperador de Persia, era la conquista de Grecia, lo que desencadenó las Guerras Médicas. Dada la gravedad de la situación, el rey Leónidas de Esparta (Gerard Butler) y 300 espartanos se enfrentaron a un ejército persa que era inmensamente superior.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Aventura","Bélica"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1271","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2007,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:56:01.651Z"},{"id":"movie-1751676","slug":"movie-1751676","title":"UFC 331: Van vs. Pantoja 2","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/72RsaYlA7M4VIFSdvUD23rWotus.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1751676","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:56:01.950Z"},{"id":"movie-1290190","slug":"movie-1290