Azteca: Choque de imperios","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wpMaI2J3ISYZiaIWNkoA1lVb5LQ.jpg","synopsis":"En la época del Imperio Azteca, Yohualli Coatl, un joven azteca, experimenta una tragedia cuando su padre y líder de la aldea, Toltecatzin, es asesinado por los conquistadores españoles. Yohualli escapa a Tenochtitlán para advertir al rey Moctezuma y a su sumo sacerdote, Yoka, del peligro inminente. Usando el templo de Tzinacan, el dios murciélago, como guarida, Yohualli entrena con su mentor y asistente, Acatzin, desarrollando equipo y armamento para enfrentar la invasión española, proteger el templo de Moctezuma y vengar la muerte de su padre.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Acción","Fantasía"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/987400","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:57:54.030Z"},{"id":"movie-1624961","slug":"movie-1624961","title":"No Ordinary Heist","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eA2uQxSMqyljAtt920084tDrw6G.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Crimen","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1624961","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:57:54.329Z"},{"id":"movie-1294972","slug":"movie-1294972","title":"ホウセンカ","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fZsog59guqRZ4Q2DqKCiLDLuyjz.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1294972","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:57:54.629Z"},{"id":"movie-1359916","slug":"movie-1359916","title":"秒速5センチメートル","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nhvPn4TsUQk5ZBk9T9RBW7v7z1J.jpg","synopsis":"Takaki cuenta la historia de su vida a medida que los tiempos cambiantes ponen a prueba sus sentimientos románticos.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Romanc