— en busca de respuestas que puedan salvarlo. Mientras se sumergen en una línea de tiempo inestable donde cada elección podría ser fatal, los tres amigos enfrentan verdades oscuras sobre sí mismos y el peso de las consecuencias que crean.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Suspense","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1312325","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:58:01.841Z"},{"id":"movie-666277","slug":"movie-666277","title":"Vidas pasadas","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jWrJrLMD7SZoxc65KSYej6QOw12.jpg","synopsis":"La familia de Nora emigra a Canadá cuando ella tiene 10 años. Pierde el contacto con su amor de la infancia. Muchos años después, cuando Nora está estudiando teatro en Nueva York, se reencuentra con él online.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Romance"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/666277","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2023,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:58:02.139Z"},{"id":"movie-1616184","slug":"movie-1616184","title":"Ich verstehe Ihren Unmut","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iXrLk4RYQVApzB9V4VE6ip5GPmV.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1616184","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:58:02.435Z"},{"id":"movie-1795475","slug":"movie-1795475","title":"Before the night began","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7gLnM4naP5iZvNP6Wlj9oJ3HV1W.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Drama","Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1795475","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T11:58:02.739Z"},{"id":"movie-1249663","slug":"movie-1249663","title":"Salvando el Zoo","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5PRVyY78aYMiUuoSIvJdMFEJz9v.jpg","synopsi